App.js edits. Add ui.helpButtons. Add state.help. readProgress validation. saveProgress. Init setHelp. Event listener. Functions.

Where to add `HELP_LEVELS`? Could just use array `const HELP_LEVELS = ['todas','primera','ultima','ninguna'];` near TERMINATIONS. Use for validation and setHelp.

Add:
```
const HELP_LEVELS = ['todas', 'primera', 'ultima', 'ninguna'];
```
`readProgress`: `help: HELP_LEVELS.includes(value?.help) ? value.help : 'todas'`.
`saveProgress`: include help.
`state`: `help: saved.help`.
Init: `setHelp(state.help);` after setTermination.
Event: `ui.helpButtons.forEach(...)`.
`setHelp(level)`:
```
function setHelp(level) {
  state.help = HELP_LEVELS.includes(level) ? level : 'todas';
  ui.helpButtons.forEach((button) => {
    const active = button.dataset.help === state.help;
    button.classList.toggle('selected', active);
    button.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(active));
  });
  if (state.rhymeRevealed && state.currentPrompt && state.format !== 'cinco') renderRhymes();
  saveProgress();
}
```
`revealRhymes`:
```
function revealRhymes() {
  state.rhymeRevealed = true;
  if (state.format === 'cinco') { ... return; }
  renderRhymes();
  ui.hit.disabled = false;
}
```
`renderRhymes`:
```
function renderRhymes() {
  const rhymes = state.currentPrompt?.rhymes || [];
  const slots = [null, null, null, null];
  if (state.help === 'todas') rhymes.slice(0,4).forEach((word, i) => { slots[i] = word; });
  else if (state.help === 'primera') slots[0] = rhymes[0] || null;
  else if (state.help === 'ultima') slots[3] = rhymes[rhymes.length - 1] || null;
  ui.rhymeList.replaceChildren(...slots.map((word, index) => {
    const chip = document.createElement('span');
    chip.className = word ? 'rhyme-chip' : 'rhyme-chip empty-chip';
    chip.textContent = word || '—';
    if (word) {
      chip.style.transitionDelay = `${index * 45}ms`;
      requestAnimationFrame(() => chip.classList.add('visible'));
    }
    return chip;
  }));
  const notes = {
    todas: '¡REMATE A TU MANERA!',
    primera: 'AYUDA: PRIMERA RIMA',
    ultima: 'AYUDA: ÚLTIMA RIMA',
    ninguna: 'SIN AYUDA · A TU MANERA',
  };
  ui.revealNote.textContent = notes[state.help] || notes.todas;
}
```
Potential issue: `rhymes` may have 4 items; `slots` 4. Good.
If `rhymes` empty (five mode), renderRhymes not called. If no rhymes for some prompt, slots all empty; fine.
`showEmptyRhymes` sets revealNote "APARECE EN EL TIEMPO 3" regardless of help; good before reveal.
When help changes after reveal to `ninguna`, all empty chips and note. Good.
When help changes before reveal, no render; when reveal happens, uses new help. Good.
Persistence: help saved.

Need `ui.helpButtons` check: `[...document.querySelectorAll('[data-help]')]`. There are 4. Good.

Let's apply.

