content.text:
Now CSS for the bar row and current pattern highlight. Also make sure the bar-row spans the grid in `.pattern-block` (display:grid grid-template-columns:auto 1fr). Add:

```css
/* R15 — Contador de barras 4/8/16 */
.bar-row{grid-column:1/-1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding-bottom:7px;border-bottom:1px solid #ffffff0a}
.bar-counter{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:4px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.7px;color:#a6a6ad}
.bar-counter-label{font-size:7px}
.bar-counter strong{font-size:15px;line-height:1;color:var(--lime);letter-spacing:0}
.bar-counter-total{font-size:9px;color:#8e8f96}
.bar-progress{width:58px;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:#ffffff12;overflow:hidden;align-self:center;margin-left:5px}
.bar-progress i{display:block;height:100%;width:0;background:var(--lime);border-radius:2px;transition:width .16s linear}
body.mode-double .bar-counter strong,body.mode-double .bar-progress i{color:var(--pink);background...}
```

Careful: `.bar-progress i` background. For double mode, pink.

```css
body.mode-double .bar-counter strong{color:var(--pink)}
body.mode-double .bar-progress i{background:var(--pink)}
.bar-switch-wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:7px;letter-spacing:.5px;color:#8e8f96}
.bar-switch{padding:2px}
.bar-switch button{padding:3px 7px;font-size:7px}
.pattern-bar.current{border-color:var(--lime);box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #d2f36b40 inset}
.pattern-bar.current .pattern-bar-label{color:var(--lime)}
body.mode-double .pattern-bar.current{border-color:var(--pink);box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #fb718540 inset}
body.mode-double .pattern-bar.current .pattern-bar-label{color:var(--pink)}
@media(max-width:590px){
  .bar-row{gap:7px}
  .bar-counter strong{font-size:13px}
  .bar-progress{width:46px}
  .bar-switch-wrap>span{font-size:6px}
}
```

Also pattern-block currently `grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;align-items:center;gap:6px 12px`. Adding bar-row as first child with grid-column 1/-1; then pattern-heading in col 1, pattern-switch col 2, pattern-strip 1/-1, rule 1/-1. Good.

Let's add CSS.

