content.text:
Now CSS for the character chip. Also maybe adjust the format-actions for three items on mobile. Add:

```css
/* R16 — Modo personaje */
.character-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap;max-width:100%;margin-top:9px;padding:4px 8px;border:1px solid #d2f36b3d;border-radius:6px;background:#2a2d22;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.4px;color:#b8c98f}
.character-chip[hidden]{display:none}
.character-badge{font-size:7px;color:#8e9a6d;letter-spacing:.6px}
.character-chip strong{font-size:9px;color:var(--lime);letter-spacing:.5px}
.character-rule{color:#a9b58a}
body.mode-double .character-chip{border-color:#fb71853d;background:#2c2024;color:#d9a3ab}
body.mode-double .character-badge{color:#b57f88}
body.mode-double .character-chip strong{color:var(--pink)}
body.mode-double .character-rule{color:#c99aa2}
@media(max-width:590px){
  .character-chip{font-size:7px;gap:5px;padding:4px 6px}
  .character-chip strong{font-size:8px}
}
```

Also, the format-actions might need `justify-content:flex-start` on desktop? Currently `justify-content:space-between` only on mobile. On desktop `.format-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}`. The format block has heading on the left and actions on the right. With 3 items, the actions may be wide. The format block is `justify-content:space-between`, heading + actions. At 1280 the challenge card is ~600px; format switch ~110 + termination ~85 + character ~80 + gaps = ~291; heading ~110; fits. Good.

On mobile, `.format-actions{width:100%;justify-content:space-between}` with 3 items. They may fit or wrap. Let's test.

Add CSS.

